{"translation":{"id":"cmn_feb","name":"免费的易读圣经 Free Easy-to-read Bible","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmnfeb","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmnfeb","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"FEB","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: 免费的易读圣经 Free Easy-to-read Bible (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"281f45e9c6d64d9cf8e618e4fd7d2d961bebba0f46a534312de0f8ea52a83755","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/books.json","numberOfBooks":27,"totalNumberOfChapters":260,"totalNumberOfVerses":7959,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"3JN","translationId":"cmn_feb","name":"约翰三书","commonName":"约翰三书","title":"约翰三书","order":64,"numberOfChapters":1,"sha256":"5501a121f8c591842ab61a4605bdf4611fac9f3317e8070f7e171f5df5859077","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/3JN/1.json","lastChapterNumber":1,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/3JN/1.json","totalNumberOfVerses":15},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["这封信来自长老，",{"noteId":0},"写给我以真理热爱的朋友该犹。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["我的朋友，祝你们所做的一切都顺利，身体健壮，就像我所知你们健全的灵性。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["有些信徒来到这里，向我讲述你对真理的忠诚，以及你如何在生活中遵循真理，对此我非常高兴。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["听说我亲爱的朋友们遵循真理，没有什么比这更让我快乐了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["我的朋友，你照顾各位兄弟",{"noteId":1},"，包括那些你不认识的人，这显示出你值得信赖。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["他们曾在教会面前充分说明了你的爱。请你照上帝所喜欢的方式，帮助他们继续其旅程，"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["因为他们为主之名旅行，没有从非信徒那里接受甚么。",{"noteId":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["所以我们应当支持他们，好让我们可以在真理中分享。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["关于这件事，我曾写信给教会，但想作领袖",{"noteId":3},"的狄特腓并不接受我的权威。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["因此，如果我真的造访，要说清楚他都做了什么。他曾恶言中伤我们；不仅如此，他还拒绝欢迎其他兄弟。他也不让其他人欢迎他们，并把那些欢迎他们的人赶出了教会。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["我的朋友，不要模仿恶，要效法善。那些做善事的人属于上帝，作恶之人不知道上帝。",{"noteId":4}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["众人都说低米丢好，真相说明了一切。我们也赞扬他，你知道我们讲的都是真理。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["我还有许多话想要说给你听，但我不想用笔墨写给你。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["盼望很快就见到你，这样我们就可以见面谈。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["愿你平安！这里的朋友们向你问候。请替我向各位朋友一一问候。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"+","text":"通常人们认为这封信的作者是约翰。","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":1}},{"noteId":1,"caller":"+","text":"基督教徒四处旅行，传播福音。","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":5}},{"noteId":2,"caller":"+","text":"原意为“异教徒。”","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":7}},{"noteId":3,"caller":"+","text":"原意为“喜欢成为第一。”","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":9}},{"noteId":4,"caller":"+","text":"原意为“没有见过上帝。”","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":11}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_feb/3JN/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/JUD/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/2JN/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}